:Actor rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                gufo:Kind .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Adaptable
:Adaptable rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                    :Disposition ;
           rdfs:comment "The ability to adjust effectively to new situations and changes." ;
           rdfs:label "Adaptable" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Ana
:Ana rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
              :Actor .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Analyze
:Analyze rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :CognitiveActionVerb ;
         :isActionVerbFor :Analyzing ;
         :verbDescription "Breaking down material into parts to understand its structure." ;
         :verbName "Analyze" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Analyzing
:Analyzing rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                    gufo:SubKind .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Apply
:Apply rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                :CognitiveActionVerb ;
       :isActionVerbFor :Applying ;
       :verbDescription "Making use of knowledge or skills." ;
       :verbName "Apply" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Applying
:Applying rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                   gufo:SubKind .


