:CE4.0 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                :CompetenceEvidence ;
       :hasCompetence :Competence1 .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#CE5.0
:CE5.0 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                :CompetenceEvidence .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Cal
:Cal rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
              :Actor .


