         :isActionVerbFor :Analyzing ;
         :verbDescription "Examining the similarities and differences." ;
         :verbName "Compare" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Competence
:Competence rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     gufo:Kind .


