:Competence1 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                      :Competence ;
             :hasDisposition :Responsible ;
             :hasKnowledge :K3 ;
             :hasSkill :Remembering .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#CompetenceACMModel
:CompetenceACMModel rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                             gufo:SubKind .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#CompetenceEvidence
:CompetenceEvidence rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
